Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.58,0:00:11.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata Nona Elmina adalah\Nahli sihir keluarga Gugglekars, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.58,0:00:13.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.12,0:00:17.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kalian!\NMinta maaf pada Lorna!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.24,0:00:20.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ujian harus dilakukan dengan adil!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.58,0:00:26.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya ada kotoran di bajuku.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.71,0:00:29.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hancurlah, Gugglekars!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.24,0:00:34.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia pasti orang berintegritas\Nyang tidak mengekor penguasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.86,0:00:41.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ka-Kalian akan masuk\Nke dungeon ini sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.40,0:00:43.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika menyelesaikan tugas,\Nkalian akan dinyatakan lulus.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.08,0:00:49.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, jika kalian kembali\Ndengan Sayap Berpulang ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.26,0:00:51.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,kalian akan gagal, jadi harap berhati-hati.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, sepertinya gampang.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.84,0:00:57.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini lebih mudah daripada ujian sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.84,0:01:00.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah, ternyata mudah.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.48,0:01:02.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke, tugasnya adalah
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.62,0:01:06.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,mengambil Inti Labirin\Nyang ada di dasar dungeon.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.46,0:01:09.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini termasuk mudah?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.40,0:01:12.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata hal yang tampak sulit ini\Nmasih dianggap biasa-biasa saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.98,0:01:17.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lorna Hermit, sekarang giliranmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.12,0:01:18.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.38,0:03:00.48,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Ini eksplorasi dungeon pertamaku,\Ntapi apa aku akan baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.46,0:03:04.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya agak seram.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.66,0:03:08.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Indah!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.24,0:03:12.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata dungeon itu\Nenggak seram sama sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus fokus ke ujian dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.72,0:03:20.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa pakai Internet itu curang?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.18,0:03:27.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pikiran macet. Solusi tanpa ribet.\NPakai Internet.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Demikian puisi tiga larik dalam hatiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.46,0:03:31.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kuperiksa!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.32,0:03:34.98,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Bagian terdalam adalah lantai sembilan, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.98,0:03:38.77,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Apa Inti Labirin itu ada di sana?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.52,0:03:42.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Internet, ngetop!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.78,0:03:43.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terus,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.96,0:03:47.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku akan ketemu monster\Nsetelah belok di jalan ini, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.06,0:03:50.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa menyihirnya dari sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.20,0:03:52.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terra Drain!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.52,0:03:59.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka jadi tak berdaya\Nkarena mana mereka habis.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.42,0:04:01.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kesempatan, nih.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.30,0:04:05.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Giant Bat itu lemah terhadap elemen es.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.12,0:04:07.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.98,0:04:11.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sip! Lancar sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.70,0:04:16.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, memang boleh menaklukkan\Ndungeon semudah ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.46,0:04:22.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku jadi agak merasa bersalah\Npada petualang lain,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.56,0:04:24.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi selain indah,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.26,0:04:26.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,tempat ini juga menghibur\Nseperti tempat piknik.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.66,0:04:29.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin aku bisa menjelajahi\Ndungeon di seluruh dunia
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.58,0:04:31.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk tujuan berwisata.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.17,0:04:34.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sa-Sampai ke dasar dungeon?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.92,0:04:37.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda memberikan tugas mustahil seperti itu?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.96,0:04:39.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, terus?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.00,0:04:42.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah tingkat kesulitan\NKuil Bawah Tanah Senjakala ini sangat tinggi
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.58,0:04:45.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan penjelajahannya\Nhanya mentok di lantai dua?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.62,0:04:46.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.04,0:04:53.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biasanya dungeon itu dibuat\Ndengan rintangan berupa teka-teki.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.94,0:04:57.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, teka-teki di lantai dua\Ndungeon ini mustahil dipecahkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.18,0:05:01.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Habisnya, jawaban teka-tekinya\Nbelum diketahui siapa pun.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.58,0:05:06.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terlebih lagi, kita akan terjebak\Nbegitu memasuki ruangan lantai dua.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.30,0:05:10.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satu-satunya cara keluar\Nadalah memakai item untuk kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.42,0:05:12.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.90,0:05:17.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku memalsukan Sayap Berpulang\Nyang kuberikan pada Lorna Hermit.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.02,0:05:18.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Artinya,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.62,0:05:22.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia akan terjebak di lantai dua.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, apa perlu sejauh itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.68,0:05:26.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.12,0:05:29.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa pemilik skill rank cemen sepertimu
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.24,0:05:32.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,berani mempertanyakan\Nkeputusan Elmina Manaflame,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.36,0:05:35.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,ahli sihir keluarga Gugglekars\Nyang sangat elite ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.04,0:05:39.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah dia tadi menentang\Nkeluarga itu habis-habisan?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika aku berhasil mengurung\Nmonster sekuat itu di tempat ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.86,0:05:46.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku pasti akan semakin disegani.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.98,0:05:51.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan akhirnya, kehidupan elite-ku\Nakan semakin cemerlang.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.58,0:05:56.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lorna Hermit tidak perlu ditakuti!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.54,0:06:00.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku benar-benar wanita\Nyang lahir di bawah bintang elite!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.86,0:06:07.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang terjadi, Nona Elmina?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.76,0:06:10.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, tiba-tiba aku ingin pulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.74,0:06:13.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong urus sisanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.52,0:06:15.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Elmina, tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.90,0:06:23.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Ini sesuai informasi di Internet.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.28,0:06:25.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang lantai empat sudah beres.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.06,0:06:29.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seharusnya dungeon ini\Nmenguji kecerdasan orang,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.82,0:06:32.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi ini tidak rumit\Nkalau sudah tahu caranya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.94,0:06:36.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, ya, pencipta dungeon ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi ini bagian terdalam, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.98,0:06:44.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya sulit dipercaya\Nkarena ini terlalu mudah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.72,0:06:48.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berikutnya lawan bos, kan?\NApa aku akan baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.32,0:06:53.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, kalau aku mengalahkan bos\Ndan berhasil mengambil Inti Labirin,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.70,0:06:55.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku akan dinyatakan lulus.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.66,0:06:57.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke! Aku akan berjuang!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.90,0:06:59.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebelum itu, lihat Internet dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.36,0:07:06.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau cuma dari informasi,\Nkekuatannya belum terbayang.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.06,0:07:10.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin dengar pendapat\Nseseorang secara langsung.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.36,0:07:13.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Forum diskusi?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.80,0:07:16.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memangnya siapa yang buka diskusi di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.26,0:07:19.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.04,0:07:21.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,ini tempat mengobrol dewa-dewa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.00,0:07:24.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dipikir-pikir, cuma dewa\Nyang bisa menulis di Internet.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.14,0:07:25.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.70,0:07:29.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa manusia fana sepertiku\Nboleh melihat ranah suci itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.42,0:07:31.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, sudah telanjur juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.42,0:07:32.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hiyah!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.31,0:07:33.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku lihat saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.97,0:07:36.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Eh? Kamu pikir sudah menang?\N- Baperan banget kamu ini, kocak.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.02,0:07:36.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Ngoyo banget. Najis kamu.\N- Baperan banget kamu ini, kocak.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.94,0:07:38.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Wajahnya pasti merah pas ngetik.\N- Padahal hasilnya udah jelas.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.06,0:07:40.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Wajahnya pasti merah pas ngetik.\N- Hei, kasih tahu warna dalemanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.32,0:07:44.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pa-Para dewa bertengkar?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.22,0:07:47.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini bahasa gaul dewa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.80,0:07:50.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti mereka sedang beradu argumen\Ntingkat tinggi
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.00,0:07:52.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang mustahil kupahami.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.24,0:07:58.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga tidak paham arti "wkwk" ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.00,0:08:01.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti itu bagian dari mantra sihir.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.44,0:08:03.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Abaikan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.38,0:08:07.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin aku lihat komentar dewa lain saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.04,0:08:08.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Bos dungeon ini lemah banget.\N- Bagusnya cuma di video pembuka.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.98,0:08:10.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Aku bisa menang tanpa damage\N- Bagusnya cuma di video pembuka.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.32,0:08:11.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,- di level satu dengan mudah.\N- Kapan zona aman diperbaiki?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.34,0:08:12.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Itu tidak penting.\N- Kapan zona aman diperbaiki?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.04,0:08:13.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Aku harap inflasi\N- Memang kalian enggak capek
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.50,0:08:15.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,- item rank S ke atas diperbaiki.\N- ngarep keseimbangan dari Etalia?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.84,0:08:18.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada beberapa tulisan yang tidak kupahami,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.16,0:08:21.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi pendapat "bos lemah" ini\Nsangat menonjol.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika sampai dibahas sebanyak ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.60,0:08:26.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,berarti bos di sini memang sangat lemah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.30,0:08:31.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, tulisan di Internet pasti benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.58,0:08:34.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku jadi sedikit tenang.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.24,0:08:37.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke! Langsung selesaikan saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.02,0:08:41.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seingatku, pintu ini akan terbuka\Njika aku mengucapkan kata kuncinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.34,0:08:43.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.68,0:08:47.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akulah yang menorehkan\Nangka sang binatang buas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gelap dan tidak kelihatan jelas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.86,0:09:09.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.86,0:09:14.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ampun! Ampun! Ampun! Ampun!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.44,0:09:17.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa bilang lemah?\NSiapa bilang lemah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo? Kok? Buka!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong! Siapa saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.90,0:09:25.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Elmina!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.04,0:09:29.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.13,0:09:32.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tidak akan bisa keluar\Nsebelum mengalahkan bos?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.58,0:09:35.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa aku dibohongi Internet?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.16,0:09:39.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, Internet tidak mungkin bohong.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.96,0:09:42.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia dirantai?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.31,0:09:45.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, kalau begitu aman...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.82,0:09:48.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh, enggak!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.44,0:09:51.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Flame! Petit Flame!\NPetit Flame!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.04,0:09:57.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sihir bisa melukainya,\Ntapi efeknya tidak seberapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak! Mati aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.18,0:10:05.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika tidak buru-buru cari tahu\Ntentang naga ini, aku bisa mati!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.00,0:10:10.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.47,0:10:16.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Ice! Petit Ice! Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.08,0:10:20.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mempan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.56,0:10:23.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini kesempatanku. Kalem, kalem.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.40,0:10:24.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini dia!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.48,0:10:28.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada zona aman?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.48,0:10:30.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Zona aman itu
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.46,0:10:33.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,di belakang altar?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.50,0:10:37.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak punya waktu berpikir!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.42,0:10:41.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill: Terjang Membabi!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa tempat ini benar-benar aman?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.62,0:10:56.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu gerakan serangan napas\Nyang katanya wajib diwaspadai?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.86,0:11:08.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.22,0:11:13.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Betulan aman, dong.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.40,0:11:16.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ukuran tangganya membuat dia kesulitan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.34,0:11:21.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika aku mengeluarkan rentetan\Nserangan jauh dari atas altar ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.40,0:11:22.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku bisa menang.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.79,0:11:24.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hap!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.82,0:11:26.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertama...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.44,0:11:27.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terra Drain!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.70,0:11:32.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dilanjut!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.17,0:11:35.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Ice! Petit Ice! Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dilanjut!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.74,0:11:39.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Istirahat sebentar.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.22,0:11:44.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku capek karena jalan terus.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.40,0:11:51.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Manisnya buah ipple terasa\Nmaknyus di tubuh letih ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.72,0:11:54.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untung saja aku jajan dulu sebelum ujian.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.36,0:11:56.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke, lanjutkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.58,0:12:03.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Ice! Petit Ice! Petit Ice!\NPetit Ice! Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.33,0:12:07.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Nyawanya banyak, jadi ini cukup lama.\N- Petit Ice! Petit Ice! Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.76,0:12:12.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia terbang?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.32,0:12:13.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.78,0:12:18.18,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Pola serangannya akan berubah\Njika nyawanya berkurang cukup banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.50,0:12:23.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bentar, bentar. Kalau dia terbang...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.62,0:12:25.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Light!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selagi dia meronta-ronta...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.14,0:12:31.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terra Drain!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.15,0:12:33.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dilanjut Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.02,0:12:35.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Ice! Petit Ice! Petit Ice!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.34,0:12:37.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika dia terbang...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.49,0:12:38.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Light!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.66,0:12:43.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ba-Bagus! Aku berhasil!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.94,0:12:46.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini adalah metode yang tertulis di Internet.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.48,0:12:47.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Menjebak dari Posisi Tinggi".
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.64,0:12:49.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.08,0:12:52.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa naga ini bodoh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.72,0:12:55.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa dia mau-mau saja\Ndikalahkan dengan pola yang sama?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.02,0:13:00.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku jadi kasihan karena dia\Ntampak tertindas secara sepihak,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.44,0:13:03.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi nyawaku juga jadi taruhannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.90,0:13:06.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini yang terakhir!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.06,0:13:08.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.14,0:13:11.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Petit Ice sekuat tenaga!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.88,0:13:33.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Be-Berhasil! Aku menang!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.42,0:13:35.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih, Internet!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.96,0:13:41.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Muncul sesuatu.\NApa ini semacam hadiah?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.72,0:13:44.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, dari siapa dan untuk apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.28,0:13:47.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagian, ini dari mana\Ndan logikanya bagaimana?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.30,0:13:53.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya, aku tadi melihat tulisan\N"Hadiah Kemenangan" di Internet.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.72,0:13:54.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebentar.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.66,0:13:57.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Setelah mengalahkan Naga Kiamat Ragnadrake,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.16,0:13:59.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,kamu akan mendapatkan perlengkapan
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.68,0:14:03.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,seri Naga Kiamat\Nsesuai gaya bertarungmu."
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.16,0:14:07.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu, masih ada\N"Perluasan Slot Item Box +50",
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.74,0:14:10.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi aku tidak tahu artinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.33,0:14:13.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau dikasih hadiah\Nya harus diterima, dong!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.64,0:14:18.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ya isinya?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.18,0:14:21.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.92,0:14:25.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku selalu mencemaskan\Ndaya pertahananku yang rendah.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.56,0:14:30.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertahanan itu memang\Nlebih penting daripada serangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.38,0:14:43.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke. Yah, intinya aku tambah kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.80,0:14:46.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah. Periksa status dulu, deh.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.58,0:14:56.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Aku jadi super-duper kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.10,0:14:59.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lebih dari level 40 itu masuk\Nyang terkuat di negara, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.44,0:15:03.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku tidak minta sejauh itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, aku senang karena levelku naik.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.62,0:15:11.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin aku betulan jadi\Nyang terkuat di dunia
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.38,0:15:13.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan menyelamatkan dunia.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.50,0:15:15.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.60,0:15:18.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin, sih.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.68,0:15:24.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Apa yang terjadi...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.62,0:15:29.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.78,0:15:33.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku datang memeriksa situasi\Nkarena sudah kewajibanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.58,0:15:38.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lantai dua sudah dilewati?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.76,0:15:40.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Secepat ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.26,0:15:42.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini bukan ulah manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin bisa begini.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.98,0:15:48.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, ini mustahil.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada seseorang?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.72,0:15:56.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana Search!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.50,0:16:02.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tempat ini dipenuhi mana\Nyang luar biasa besar?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.72,0:16:07.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah berada di dalam mana\Nyang dikeluarkan orang itu?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.02,0:16:12.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat. Mana-nya terlalu pekat\Nsampai membuatku sulit bernapas.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.06,0:16:17.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski begitu, sosoknya belum terlihat.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.82,0:16:22.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bulu?\NKenapa ada di tempat seperti ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.12,0:16:23.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Elmina!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.86,0:16:33.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sa-Sayap?!\NApa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.86,0:16:36.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa Lorna Hermit bukan manusia?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.94,0:16:39.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.10,0:16:43.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,A-Apa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.90,0:16:45.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ruangnya terdistorsi?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.26,0:16:47.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan dibunuh!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.42,0:16:53.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku berhasil menyelesaikan tugas\Ndan mendapatkan Inti Labirin di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.88,0:16:59.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan-jangan, itu tadi sihir ruang\Nyang legendaris?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.02,0:17:02.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagian,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,apa itu benar-benar Inti Labirin?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.04,0:17:08.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia menaklukkan dungeon\Ndalam waktu sesingkat ini?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.18,0:17:10.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.29,0:17:14.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku dinyatakan lulus, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.84,0:17:20.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.42,0:17:22.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus menggagalkannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.32,0:17:24.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika tidak...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.24,0:17:28.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,kehidupan elite-ku!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.58,0:17:30.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus kabur dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.14,0:17:36.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.38,0:17:39.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu mau ke mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.66,0:17:47.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.04,0:17:50.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu lulus.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.17,0:17:51.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Asyik!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.32,0:17:52.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak mungkin.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.44,0:17:55.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak berani menggagalkan orang ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.98,0:18:01.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa keluarga Gugglekars\Nmengusir monster seperti ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.26,0:18:03.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.30,0:18:06.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong jaga dirimu baik-baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.72,0:18:07.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.14,0:18:10.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kamu tidak hati-hati,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.56,0:18:13.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,mungkin kamu akan mati dalam waktu dekat.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.82,0:18:17.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya aku dibunuh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.16,0:18:28.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu.\NMending balik kampung.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.48,0:18:34.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak mau berurusan\Ndengan monster seperti itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.40,0:18:46.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Elmina benar-benar baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.86,0:18:50.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia sampai masuk dungeon\Nkarena mengkhawatirkanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.58,0:18:51.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.04,0:18:56.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kuharap dia tidak mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.26,0:19:01.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Internet itu bisa tahu\Nkapan orang akan mati, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.04,0:19:05.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semoga peringatanku tadi bisa\Nmenjauhkannya dari takdir maut.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.18,0:19:09.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.14,0:19:15.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Skill "Enchant Wing" ini\Nsangat praktis dan membantu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.58,0:19:18.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan ini, aku tidak perlu\Ncapek-capek berjalan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.20,0:19:21.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, Item Box ini juga bermanfaat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.20,0:19:24.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menurut Internet,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.90,0:19:29.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku bisa menyimpan lima puluh\Njenis benda ke dalam lubang ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.00,0:19:30.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sangat praktis.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.10,0:19:33.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitulah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.90,0:19:37.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jreng-jreng!\NAku sudah bikin kartu petualang!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.45,0:19:39.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu hebat, Lorna!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.58,0:19:42.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu pecah rekor karena\Nlangsung dapat rank silver!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.12,0:19:48.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu, kamu berhasil lulus\Nujian Elmina Manaflame?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.32,0:19:49.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu benar-benar hebat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.18,0:19:52.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.16,0:19:56.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kamu selalu seperti ini, Reinharte?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.90,0:19:59.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat senang karena\Nkamu menyembuhkan lututku.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.02,0:20:01.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh, aku?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.86,0:20:05.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebelum bertemu denganmu,\Naku sudah seperti mayat hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.46,0:20:07.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, kamu menyelamatkanku,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.70,0:20:10.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan aku mulai melihat harapan dalam hidupku.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.40,0:20:14.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku jadi ingat bahwa dunia ini begitu indah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.92,0:20:20.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga ingin jadi petualang sepertimu,\Nyang bisa menyelamatkan orang lain.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.26,0:20:24.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa aku melakukan sesuatu yang hebat, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.82,0:20:27.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, apa kamu akan mulai bertugas hari ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.28,0:20:31.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, iya. Namun, aku hanya\Nmengumpulkan herba, kok.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.54,0:20:35.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski sudah sekuat itu,\Nkamu tetap rendah hati,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.16,0:20:38.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan mengerjakan misi sederhana\Nyang bermanfaat untuk orang lain.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.58,0:20:42.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma ingin mulai dengan misi mudah dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.12,0:20:47.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu, mengumpulkan herba\Ncukup cocok untuk mencari uang.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.60,0:20:49.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengumpulkan herba, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.04,0:20:51.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.14,0:20:54.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belakangan ini, ada penyakit aneh\Nyang menyebar di kota.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.56,0:20:57.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi permintaan herba sedang tinggi.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.02,0:21:00.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu memilih misi itu karena bermanfaat
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.02,0:21:01.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk orang banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.81,0:21:03.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamu memang hebat, Lorna.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.54,0:21:08.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak bisa bilang\Nkalau ini 100% demi uang.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.92,0:21:12.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, bukankah bertualang\Nsendirian itu terlalu berbahaya?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.30,0:21:17.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengintai musuh, bertarung,\Ndan membawa barang sendiri itu
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.10,0:21:19.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,butuh keahlian luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.30,0:21:24.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kamu tadi bilang sesuatu?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.82,0:21:26.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ti-Tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.08,0:21:29.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pergi dulu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.18,0:21:35.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lorna benar-benar seperti malaikat.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.82,0:21:40.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak pernah dengar\Ntentang skill terbang.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.70,0:21:47.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah bicara dengannya,\Nduniaku terasa begitu kecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.96,0:21:52.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga harus berjuang dalam pemulihan
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.00,0:21:53.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan mengejarnya secepat mungkin.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.82,0:21:58.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lorna Hermit adalah raja iblis...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.63,0:22:01.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dunia ini akan berakhir...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.00,0:22:04.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika dunia berakhir,\Nmaka kehidupan elite-ku...
